    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Become the Master Gunsmith of the Wild West!</strong><br>In <i>Armory Simulator</i>, immerse yourself in the captivating and unforgiving world of the Wild West, where every bullet counts, and every customer has a story to tell. Your mission? Build, manage, and expand your own armory, catering to the needs of cowboys, bounty hunters, and outlaws seeking the finest equipment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Manage Your Shop:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and trade a wide variety of firearms, ammunition, accessories, and customizable items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business by decorating your shop and attracting a diverse clientele with smart marketing strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd20 <strong>A Dynamic World:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a colorful cast of characters, from sheriffs seeking reliable guns to outlaws looking to defend themselves against bounty hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape your reputation: will you be a respected arms dealer or the preferred supplier for bandits?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf35 <strong>Immersive Wild West Experience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an authentic atmosphere with dusty landscapes, lively saloons, and a soundtrack straight out of the Wild West.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenges such as stock management and the unpredictable life of the frontier.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Adventure in the Wild West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Armory Simulator</i> is not just a management game: it\u2019s an adventure in a world where every choice matters. Can you build a thriving business and survive this unforgiving environment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Sharpen your rifles, load your pistols, and open the doors to your armory. The Wild West is waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add <i>Armory Simulator</i> to your wishlist now and get ready for a one-of-a-kind adventure in the Wild West!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Become the Master Gunsmith of the Wild West!</strong><br>In <i>Armory Simulator</i>, immerse yourself in the captivating and unforgiving world of the Wild West, where every bullet counts, and every customer has a story to tell. Your mission? Build, manage, and expand your own armory, catering to the needs of cowboys, bounty hunters, and outlaws seeking the finest equipment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Manage Your Shop:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and trade a wide variety of firearms, ammunition, accessories, and customizable items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business by decorating your shop and attracting a diverse clientele with smart marketing strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd20 <strong>A Dynamic World:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a colorful cast of characters, from sheriffs seeking reliable guns to outlaws looking to defend themselves against bounty hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape your reputation: will you be a respected arms dealer or the preferred supplier for bandits?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf35 <strong>Immersive Wild West Experience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an authentic atmosphere with dusty landscapes, lively saloons, and a soundtrack straight out of the Wild West.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenges such as stock management and the unpredictable life of the frontier.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Adventure in the Wild West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Armory Simulator</i> is not just a management game: it\u2019s an adventure in a world where every choice matters. Can you build a thriving business and survive this unforgiving environment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Sharpen your rifles, load your pistols, and open the doors to your armory. The Wild West is waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add <i>Armory Simulator</i> to your wishlist now and get ready for a one-of-a-kind adventure in the Wild West!</strong></p>",
